{{Deity|name=Tefnut|title=Storm's Fury|symbol=Pyramid and sun|alignment=Neutral Good|power=Intermediate Power|pantheon=[[Pharaonic pantheon]]|gender=Feminine|realm=[[Windwrath]]|portfolio=Storms, rain, running water|cleric alignments=Any}}
'''Tefnut''' was an Intermediate power of the [[Pharaonic pantheon]], the daughter of [[Ra]] and member of the Ennead family.<ref>{{Cite book/On Hallowed Ground|84}}</ref> She was the wife of [[Shu]] and mother of [[Geb]] and [[Nut]]. Tefnut was a power of volatile moods, which manifested in weather patterns for worshippers to read. She wasn't regarded as cruel, but she didn't hesitate to unleash her fury on those who incurred it.<ref name=":0">{{Cite book/On Hallowed Ground|91}}</ref>
Tefnut ruled the realm of [[Windwrath]] on [[Shurrock]], a network of villages on and within one of [[Bytopia]]'s many mountains.<ref name=":0" /> == References ==
